{
  "_comment": [
    "THE provider-for contract (ADR-022 sections 1 and 7, #1614). One table, read",
    "by both languages: internal/models TestProviderForOpenCode,",
    "TestDispatchModelForOpenCode and TestIsLocalProvider, and the SDK's",
    "tests/eval/modelRegistry.test.ts. A Go/SDK disagreement fails one side.",
    "provider_for: providerFor(adapter, model). For opencode rows, bare_id is the",
    "model id after the first slash, and upstream is always the model unchanged.",
    "A malformed model is provider other with an empty bare_id.",
    "dispatch_model_for: dispatchModelFor(adapter, band_or_id, configured_model),",
    "where configured_model is the opencode.model default. A row has either",
    "model (the -m value) or error: true."
  ],
